Package: mediaplanrapp
Title: Media Plan Workbench
Version: 0.1.0
Type: App
Description: Build, edit and compare media plans. Upload a plan, reshape it in a
    spreadsheet-style grid or by asking an assistant, fork named scenarios off
    it, and compare them as tables and charts. All plan semantics come from the
    mediaplanr package; this app does no modelling.
